* AD8551 Non-Inverting Amplifier

* Power Supply (Single 5V)
VDD VDD 0 5
VSS VSS 0 0

* Input Signal: 25mV DC bias to keep single-supply op-amp in linear region, 
* 10mV amplitude sine at 1kHz for TRAN, AC 1 for AC sweep.
VIN IN 0 SINE(25m 10m 1k) AC 1

* Feedback Network (Gain = 1 + R2/R1 = 1 + 99k/1k = 100)
R1 IN_MINUS 0 1k
R2 OUT IN_MINUS 99k

* Op-Amp Instantiation (Standard 5-pin: IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT)
X1 IN IN_MINUS VDD VSS OUT AD8551

* Analysis Directives
.ac dec 10 100 10k
.tran 0 5m

* Measurement Directives
.meas AC gain_db FIND 20*log10(mag(V(OUT))) AT 1k

.end
